{"id":"660315","name":"酱肉炒藕丝","author":"清水淡竹","authorId":"8451954","desc":"","cover":"images/660315/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"酱肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"莲藕","amount":"适量"},{"name":"青红椒","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白醋","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"酱肉切条。","img":"images/660315/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"莲藕去皮切丝，青红椒切丝。","img":"images/660315/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"水中加点白醋，放入莲藕焯水2分钟，捞出沥去水。","img":"images/660315/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"酱肉放锅中小火煸炒出油。","img":"images/660315/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入藕丝翻炒片刻。","img":"images/660315/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入青红椒丝翻炒2分钟，加盐、料酒增香调味，炒匀。","img":"images/660315/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"香脆爽口。","img":"images/660315/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}